# The LexLean revision this repository is checked with, and the only place it is
# written (AGENTS.md R1). .github/workflows/lexlean.yml builds `lexlean` at this
# commit and fails unless that binary computes the language-1.2 compiler-semantics
# ID that lexlean.lock records.
#
# Development imports upstream commits; a release pins only upstream releases.
# Move this line together with `lexlean lock`, in one commit: the lock is made by
# the compiler this line names.
#
# Currently: the head of UOR-Foundation/LexLean release/v0.4 at 5dccf9e5b (version
# 0.4.0), which carries SM-37 (`nested_induction`) and DF-19 (the recursive family
# of a nested type). The v0.4.0 release tag (e0b74b81e) does not; the pin moves to
# a LexLean release that does before any release of this repository.
rev = 5dccf9e5ba20d91d81f4f702f46a79e8b363bfb6
